sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as MirageAPI
    participant CAT as Catalog
    participant AP as Approval
    participant ORCH as Orchestrator
    participant G as Ghost

    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/dependencies/proposals
    API->>CAT: validate seed and dependency entries
    CAT-->>API: proposal created pending approval
    API-->>FE: 202 proposal id

    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/dependencies/proposals/{proposal_id}/approve
    API->>AP: record manual approval
    AP-->>API: approved
    API-->>FE: 200 approved

    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/dependencies/proposals/{proposal_id}/execute
    API->>ORCH: execute approved install plan
    ORCH->>G: install command with approved method
    G-->>ORCH: install event and status
    ORCH-->>API: execution result and audit state
    API-->>FE: 200 execution report

    Note over ORCH,G: Stream transfer is allowed only from Mirage to Ghost
